      "t": "Значит, он дома.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Вы хотите войти?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Проходите.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's listen to their conversation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Здрасте.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello.' A simple greeting to start the day.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Доброе утро.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good morning.' She is polite but worried.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Это Макс?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is this Max?' She wants to make sure she is talking to the right person.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Да, это я.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, it is me.' He confirms his identity.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я ищу его.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am looking for him.' She means the Chef.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Дома не могу ему дозвониться.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'At home I can't reach him.' She tried calling but there was no answer.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Где он?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Where is he?' She is getting impatient.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Я не знаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't know.' He is genuinely confused.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Наверное, ключи висят.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Probably, the keys are hanging.' He notices the keys on the wall.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Значит, он дома.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So, he is home.' A logical conclusion.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Вы хотите войти?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you want to come in?' He offers her to enter.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Проходите.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come in.' He steps aside to let her pass. Now let's hear the whole thing once more.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Здрасте.",
      "gap": 0.5
